{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50715","headline":"题润州李尚书北固新楼 · 张祜","name":"题润州李尚书北固新楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蹑石攀云一迳危，粉廊朱槛眺江湄。\n青山半在潮来处，碧海先看月满时。\n树色转烟城斗峻，水光浮草岸遥卑。\n西楼又起公羊意，坐对寒潮向渺弥。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张祜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50715.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50715","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}